> `docs/toolkit-capabilities.md:274` — *"creating front-panel objects from nothing | **no op** … a free-standing control needs `New VI Object` … **never built**"*

— against the route the whole recipe rests on, already written up one file over at `docs/NAMES.md:474`. The recipe's "WHAT ALREADY EXISTED" block (`tools/recipes/stage_d1_s3a_focus_ind.py:9-24`) consults `gscript.py` and the two diagnostics, not the capability table that would have told it — wrongly — that the stage is impossible. Two one-line edits; they also give judgement a `FIXED:` path whose mtime postdates this review.

